</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Island\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Region</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Finlay</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Shop\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Shop</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">The Oak Depot</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Price\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Price</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">$45,000</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Function\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Function</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Changes processed logs into planks, increasing the price.</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content\">\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Date Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">?</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\">Description</span></h2>\n<p>The <b>Industrial Planker</b> is a machine that can be purchased from <a href=\"/wiki/The_Oak_Depot\" title=\"The Oak Depot\"><b><u>The Oak Depot</u></b></a> for $45,000. It converts sanded logs into planks; it is the woodworking counterpart to the <b><a href=\"/wiki/Industrial_Forge\" title=\"Industrial Forge\"><u>Industrial Forge</u></a></b>, increasing the sell price of <b>wood</b>.\n</p><p><i>Note: the <a href=\"/wiki/Statistic_Tool\" title=\"Statistic Tool\"><u>Statistic Tool</u></a> falsely purports not, but the <b>Industrial Planker</b></i> does <i>increase the price of <b>wood</b>.</i>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Appearance\">Appearance</span></h2>\n<p>The <b>Industrial Planker</b> has a very similar look to metalworking machinery, sporting a control panel that can be used to modify the output size of planks. It shares the same colouring and material used on the <b><u><a href=\"/wiki/Industrial_Forge\" title=\"Industrial Forge\">Industrial Forge</a></u></b>.\n</p>\n<ul><li>If an object blocking the output, it will not produce (same with forgers and plankers).\n<ul><li>During blockage it will save entered materials (the amount of them is shown in stat info menu), after removing blockage it will produce all queued materials from first entered to last entered.</li></ul></li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260903163340\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.026 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.034 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 62/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 38/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 5/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 28/5000000 bytes\nLua time usage: 0.005/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1019506/104857600 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   25.373      1 Template:Objects\n100.00%   25.373      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.9_prod_oaklands:pcache:idhash:3159-0!sseVary=RegularPage!FandomDesktop!LegacyGalleries and timestamp 20260903163340 and revision id 21099. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>","categories":[],"links":[{"title":"Industrial Forge","exists":true},{"title":"Statistic Tool","exists":true},{"title":"The Oak Depot","exists":true}],"images":["Industrial-Planker-UNBOXED.webp","Industrial-Planker-BOXED.webp"]}
